MIGraphX provider: one compiled program per input shape, reused within the session (apply after
ort-migraphx-cache-name.patch).

The provider kept one program per fused node and re-parsed and recompiled the model whenever the input shape
changed, so tiled inference (full tiles alternating with edge tiles) recompiled at almost every tile. Each node now
keeps the programs of its 4 most recently used input-shape sets (each program holds its own GPU copy of the
weights), keyed like the disk cache, and switches to a kept program instead of recompiling.

